/*
  ChangesPanel.strings
  TeslaSync — P4 feature view · 0030 · ChangesPanel (Apple)

  The P1/S10 i18n catalog contribution for this surface. Every key the native
  ChangesPanel resolves (table "ChangesPanel") lives here with its web
  `t(key, default)` English value. These entries fold into the app
  Localizable.xcstrings master catalog at integration time; they are kept in a
  per-surface table so each parallel surface prompt owns its own strings without
  editing the shared catalog (parallel-safe across the concurrent slots).

  Keys are the exact ones extracted from the web source
  (web/src/features/admin/components/feature-flags/ChangesPanel.tsx). The remaining
  keys back the native-only chrome (panel title, freshness chip, retry/error/offline
  copy) and the per-operation token labels the web Badge renders verbatim.
*/

